WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.632
Machine learning fits a rule to data:

2
00:00:02.632 --> 00:00:07.504
the model is shown past returns and the right answers, and it looks for a link.

3
00:00:07.504 --> 00:00:10.402
The key to testing it is the walk-forward test:

4
00:00:10.402 --> 00:00:14.102
for each day, the model learns only from the days before it.

5
00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:19.204
The nearest-neighbour method, on the same data it learned from,

6
00:00:19.204 --> 00:00:21.027
guesses 100 percent of days:

7
00:00:21.027 --> 00:00:23.045
it simply remembers the answer.

8
00:00:23.045 --> 00:00:27.017
In a walk-forward test it gets 49 percent, worse than a coin.

9
00:00:27.017 --> 00:00:30.142
The more flexible the model, the bigger the gap.

10
00:00:30.142 --> 00:00:33.918
Under honest testing, all variants stay around 50 percent.
